    "body": "@WanhedaNC \r\n_it shows all new trackers one per line and no white space between each line,_ that's right. But internally, the editor can **only work with different tiers.** You can check/verify the torrent file with the final result with other editors.\r\n\r\nTo optimize findability,  30+ individual tiers should be used. And the torrent program should always publish all tiers.\r\n\r\nThis program is not suitable for single-tier torrent concept.\r\n",
